# Tra le Porte: drawn with the OpenKart circuit designer on OpenStreetMap streets.
# 1.63 km: Piazza di Porta San Vitale, Via San Vitale, Via Giuseppe Petroni, Piazza Giuseppe Verdi, Via Zamboni, Piazza di Porta San Donato, Viale Quirico Filopanti, Piazza di Porta San Vitale.
# Its streets: sh tools/fetch-osm.sh 44.4920,11.3475,44.5005,11.3610 osm/porte.json (or the designer's extract)
# Build it: sh tools/new-track.sh games/pachino-gp porte.kart porte-extract.json

track porte
    name Tra le Porte
    text Bologna's university quarter: in at Porta San Vitale, along Via San Vitale and up Via
    text Petroni to Piazza Verdi, under the porticoes of Via Zamboni to Porta San Donato, and
    text back down the Viali under the plane trees.
    osm porte.track
    laps 3
    route way 23183655 forward from 250734851 to 7888475359
    route way 1490523111 forward from 7888475359 to 251846404
    route way 1473382095 forward from 251846404 to 1551062920
    route way 298745601 forward from 1551062920 to 251846509
    route way 455333846 forward from 251846509 to 3005657901
    route way 238688553 backward from 3005657901 to 2464898276
    route way 23218632 backward from 2464898276 to 250763758
    route way 260478261 backward from 250763758 to 2464898339
    route way 152026703 forward from 2464898339 to 250704263
    route way 1351849614 forward from 250704263 to 3309598939
    route way 239393662 forward from 3309598939 to 3309598943
    route way 239824974 forward from 3309598943 to 250704266
