    start Viale Quirico Filopanti 0.65
    widen 1.25
    min-width 8.5
    verge 5
    scenery 60
    landmark gate Porta San Donato
    landmark gate Torresotto di San Vitale
    landmark gate Porta San Vitale
    dress tree tree_oak.glb every 13 offset 2 scale 6.5 9 face random along Viale Quirico Filopanti
    dress lamp lightPostModern.glb every 34 side right offset 0.6 scale 8 face road along Via Zamboni
    dress lamp lightPostModern.glb every 34 side right offset 0.6 scale 8 face road along Via San Vitale
    dress cone cone.glb every 9 offset 0.4 scale 1.5 face road along Via Giuseppe Petroni
    baskets every 400 first 200 across 4
    pad Viale Quirico Filopanti 0.23
    pad Via Zamboni 0.24
    look sky 9fc8e8
    look ground c9b79a
    look palette c8553d d9a441 b5452f e0b36a cf7a52 a9432f e6c88e
